      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Right, thank you, you can get dressed. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with possible bowel ischaemia at this stage. We should do an urgent CT angiogram for possible bowel ischaemia. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Urgent blood tests is what I'd like next, for severe abdominal pain.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:07",
      "end_timestamp": "05:31",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "procedures_and_investigations[1]",
